 "intro_zh": "岳阳楼位于湖南省岳阳市古城西门城墙之上，下瞰洞庭，前望君山，有“洞庭天下水，岳阳天下楼”之美誉。君山岛古称洞庭山、湘山、有缘山，是八百里洞庭湖中的一个小岛，与千古名楼岳阳楼遥遥相对。",
 "intro_en": "The Yueyang Tower is located on the west gate wall of the ancient city of Yueyang City, Hunan Province. It overlooks the Dongting below and Junshan in front. It has the reputation of \"water is in the world in Dongting, and the tower is in the sky in Yueyang\". Junshan Island, known as Dongting Mountain, Xiang Mountain, and Youyuan Mountain in ancient times, is a small island in the 800-mile Dongting Lake, far opposite the Yueyang Tower, a famous tower through the ages.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
